.PP
The fixed part is about 35 MB. A zone costs about 2.4 to 2.7 KB when it has 11
records and about 12 KB when it has 98 records, so the cost follows the number
of records far more than the number of zones; a zone from a file costs about 0.2
KB more than the same zone from the database, and loading a million zone files
took 188 s against 34 s for the same zones from SQLite3. The routers and the
manager show the same resident size as the Backend with zone files, but they
share those pages with it: the host's memory use rose by the Backend's size once
(2,657 MB for 1,000,000 small zone files), so count the Backend's resident size
once, not the sum of the processes.
.PP
